POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "How do I connect to the company VPN?"
}

### Chat — ticket triage
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What severity should I use for a production outage ticket?"
}

### Chat — list emails
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "List my recent emails."
}

